      "id": "claim_a56ba5f0ad91490d8aa3d91eaf4181b2",
      "statement": "The client is a fat-client SPA by design: long-lived sessions make startup time less critical, gadget sandboxing requires client-side execution, and a clean RPC boundary supports alternative clients.",
