    {
      "id": "claim_07589a42d2814378931e410e166f360b",
      "statement": "The API is served over both WebSocket upgrades and HTTP batch POSTs at /api; batch responses set Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * because the API is designed to be cross-origin safe through in-band authorization.",
