      "statement": "The API surface is a capability hierarchy of RpcTargets: PublicApi (pre-auth) -> AuthenticatedApi (per-user, hands out Overseer stubs) -> Overseer (per workspace, hands out GadgetClient stubs) -> GadgetClient/GatekeeperClient (per gadget/connection), each method returning RpcStub capabilities.",
