      "statement": "The API is shaped for Cap'n Web promise pipelining: openGadget() combines share-key redemption and opening in one round trip and throws (rather than returning null) on missing gadgets so pipelined chains fail fast, and clients pipeline calls on returned stubs without awaiting.",
